    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d548">

                <pb facs="0773" n="753" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg753"/>

                <head>Mr. Burnley to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-10-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 27, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit to you a copy
                    of a despatch which the governor general of Canada has written in answer to a
                    communication from <pb facs="0774" n="754" xml:id="pg754"/> Mr. Burnley,
                    enclosing a copy of the note dated 13th instant, in which you asked for the
                    extradition of certain persons passing under the names of Bell, Hoult, Bristow,
                    Robert Drake, Burley, and Thomas.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LYONS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d548-a1.xml" xpointer="d548-a1"/>
            </div>
